        "id": 1000016
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-07-13T23:37:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it would probably be less expensive (in terms of cpu power) to continue passing around an opaque (void *) containing the pointer to the struct pd_physical rather than doing array computation in each function.",
      "revId": "34dd82d73c2c06acef11f0fd3e0b027f3631ba29",
