      "writtenOn": "2014-07-13T23:37:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "since we have possibly 2 different interrupt handlers we can avoid this.\nmaybe just a 2-stage handler\npd_rx_handler(int port)\ncalled from the real interrupt handler \npd_rx_handler(0)\nand \npd_rx_handler(1)",
